.news/items/cmsfzhw1v009hrodlv4wn36l3","title":"Google Assistant 下月起逐步退场，“Hey Google”将由谷歌 Gemini 接棒","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsfzhw1v009hrodlv4wn36l3","https://www.ithome.com/0/986/174.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsfzhw1v009hrodlv4wn36l3","title":"Google Assistant 下月起逐步退场，“Hey Google”将由谷歌 Gemini 接棒","originalTitle":"","summary":"谷歌通过电子邮件通知安卓用户，移动端 Google Assistant 将从 9 月 4 日起陆续停止服务，符合条件的安卓设备将改用 Gemini 作为默认助理。设备完成切换后，用户无法再通过手机、平板电脑或配对设备使用 Google Assistant，也不能切回原有服务。与手机配对的 Wear OS 手表及受支持的头戴式耳机和入耳式耳机也将同步改用 Gemini。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsfzhw1v009hrodlv4wn36l3","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/986/174.htm","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsfzhw1v009hrodlv4wn36l3","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"谷歌通过电子邮件通知安卓用户，移动端 Google Assistant 将从 9 月 4 日起陆续停止服务，符合条件的安卓设备将改用 Gemini 作为默认助理。设备完成切换后，用户无法再通过手机、平板电脑或配对设备使用 Google Assistant，也不能切回原有服务。与手机配对的 Wear OS 手表及受支持的头戴式耳机和入耳式耳机也将同步改用 Gemini。","reportEdition":"2026-08-06","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsga8g7n01dxro3psolcouz4","ti