itle":"美国上诉法院推翻禁令，Perplexity AI 购物智能体重返 Amazon","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsfyb5yy0js6roch27nbq7s2","https://the-decoder.com/us-appeals-court-allows-perplexitys-ai-shopping-agent-back-on-amazon"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsfyb5yy0js6roch27nbq7s2","title":"美国上诉法院推翻禁令，Perplexity AI 购物智能体重返 Amazon","originalTitle":"","summary":"美国第九巡回上诉法院推翻了此前阻止 Perplexity 在 Amazon 平台使用 AI 购物智能体的禁令，认定是用户而非 Perplexity 本身通过智能体访问 Amazon，因此违反联邦计算机欺诈法的指控难以成立。这是美国联邦上诉法院首次就 AI 智能体合法性作出裁决，但案件本身尚未了结。Amazon 表示不同意该裁决并正在评估下一步选项。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsfyb5yy0js6roch27nbq7s2","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/us-appeals-court-allows-perplexitys-ai-shopping-agent-back-on-amazon","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsfyb5yy0js6roch27nbq7s2","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uslcxv","name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"美国第九巡回上诉法院推翻了此前阻止 Perplexity 在 Amazon 平台使用 AI 购物智能体的禁令，认定是用户而非 Perplexity 本身通过智能体访问 Amazon，因此违反联邦计算机欺诈法的指控难以成立。这是美国联邦上诉法院首次就 AI 智能体合法性作出裁决，但案件本身尚未了结。Amazon 表示不同意该裁决并正在评估下一步选项。","reportEdition":"2026-08-06","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsg5h9ax06dsrolg11p7nhvv","title":"Cloudflare 提出智能体访问模型（Agent Access Model）","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsg5h9ax06dsrolg11p7nhvv","https://blog.cloudflare.com/the-agent-access-model"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsg5h9ax06dsrolg11p7nhvv","title":"Cloudflare 提出智能体访问模型（Agent Access Model）","originalTitle":"","summary":"Cloudflare 发布《The Agent Access Model》论文，提出面向 AI 智能体的访问控制模型 AAM，核心规则是“不信任运行”，对任务执行图中的每个动作基于智能体身份、授权任务及已触达资源进行实时授权。该模型针对智能体的短暂性、机器速度、提示词非边界及跨跳组合权限四大特性设计，主张缩小能力集而非仅优化单次决策，并区分单主体控制与多人访问控制的难点。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsg5h9ax06dsrolg11p7nhvv","originalUrl":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/the-agent-access-model","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1cb1g1c","originalSourceName":"Cloudflare Blog","family":"outlet-1vjpq3u","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsg5h9ax06dsrolg11p7nhvv","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1cb1g1c","name":"Cloudflare Blog","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"Cloudflare 发布《The Agent Access Model》论文，提出面向 AI 智能体的访问控制模型 AAM，核心规则是“不信任运行”，对任务执行图中的每个动作基于智能体身份、授权任务及已触达资源进行实时授权。该模型针对智能体的短暂性、机器速度、提示词非边界及跨跳组合权限四大特性设计，主张缩小能力集而非仅优化单次决策，并区分单主体控制与多人访问控制的难点。","reportEdition":"2026-08-06","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsgonfuv0bparo5q6a2ng1pd","title":"驯服扩散 Transformer 中的离群 token：Dual-Stage Registers 干预","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsgonfuv0bparo5q6a2ng1pd","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/taming-outlier-tokens"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsgonfuv0bparo5q6a2ng1pd","title":"驯服扩散 Transformer 中的离群 token：Dual-Stage Registers 干预","originalTitle":"","summary":"研究发现扩散 Transformer（DiT）图像生成流程中，预训练 ViT 编码器和 DiT 去噪器均会产生离群 token，尤其在中间层，且简单掩蔽高范数 token 无法改善性能，问题与局部 patch 语义损坏相关。为此提出 Dual-Stage Registers（DSR）干预方法，在 ImageNet 和文生图任务上持续减少离群伪影并提升生成质量。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsgonfuv0bparo5q6a2ng1pd","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/taming-outlier-tokens","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsgonfuv0bparo5q6a2ng1pd","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"研究发现扩散 Transformer（DiT）图像生成流程中，预训练 ViT 编码器和 DiT 去噪器均会产生离群 token，尤其在中间层，且简单掩蔽高范数 token 无法改善性能，问题与局部 patch 语义损坏相关。为此提出 Dual-Stage Registers（DSR）干预方法，在 ImageNet 和文生图任务上持续减少离群伪影并提升生成质量。","reportEdition