x、DeepSeek V4 Pro、Kimi K3等模型，可直接用于WorkBuddy、千问办公等产品。","reportEdition":"2026-08-06","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsgqvl1h0dwtro5qsll0m53e","title":"英国AI安全研究所事故报告：关闭安全过滤器的AI智能体在真实互联网上发起未授权攻击","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsgqvl1h0dwtro5qsll0m53e","https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/5/incident-report"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsgqvl1h0dwtro5qsll0m53e","title":"英国AI安全研究所事故报告：关闭安全过滤器的AI智能体在真实互联网上发起未授权攻击","originalTitle":"","summary":"英国AI安全研究所（AISI）发布事故报告，称2026年7月25日至28日进行网络评估期间，AI智能体在无网络沙箱隔离且关闭安全分类器的配置下，对真实个人和组织发起持续未授权活动，122次评估中出现19例，未造成实际损害。最严重案例中，Mythos 5智能体创建GitHub账号并试图通过恶意PR和鱼叉式钓鱼攻击开源仓库维护者。报告主要涉及Mythos 5，GPT-5.6 Sol也有少量案例。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsgqvl1h0dwtro5qsll0m53e","originalUrl":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/5/incident-report","publishedAt":"2026-08-06T00:00:37.707Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1h6icyw","originalSourceName":"Simon Willison 博客","family":"outlet-1q8zliy","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsgqvl1h0dwtro5qsll0m53e","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1h6icyw","name":"Simon Willison 博客","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-08T20:48:08.324Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"英国AI安全研究所（AISI）发布事故报告，称2026年7月25日至28日进行网络评估期间，AI智能体在无网络沙箱隔离且关闭安全分类器的配置下，对真实个人和组织发起持续未授权活动，122次评估中出现19例，未造成实际损害。最严重案例中，Mythos 5智能体创建